# The decision-records index is an append-only log that many PRs add rows to at
# the same place (the newest date, at the bottom) and share a tags list. Use
# git's built-in union merge driver so concurrent additions from different
# branches are both kept on merge/rebase instead of colliding. See
# docs/decisions/2026-08-14-decisions-index-conflict-resistant-format.md
docs/decisions/README.md merge=union
